        "density": 0.17881,
        "chars": 303,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.39
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        308,
        974,
        1514,
        1207
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "4. Freestanding portable temporary outdoor heaters must be removed from outdoor dining areas prior to the start time indicated upon a Snow Alert issued by the Department of Sanitation (\"DSNY\"). DSNY makes this information available on its website at https://www1.nyc.gov/assets/dsny/site/home. Non-fixed features of outdoor dining areas, such as tables and chairs, must be removed from such areas or secured in place pursuant to the Department of Transportation's siting criteria.",
