      "category": "Text",
      "text": "c. In addition to the requirements set forth above, any use of a temporary outdoor heater pursuant to this section shall adhere to applicable guidance issued by DOB, available on DOB's website at https://www1.nyc.gov/site/buildings/codes/building-bulletins-current.page, and by FDNY, available on FDNY's website at https://www1.nyc.gov/site/fdny/business/support/restaurant-help.page.",
